{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:748bbc7605f3baf8285950b73afea7b753b79d5f1150a43c6b9057f301e06309",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49900e72c69958cf42989e772a8683a45f2247aed0ed3f59fe6f82bce561b3a1",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我这边已经换好衣服了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16a09dafdd9946eb0d2e3fa909bb455286abf0c89c7fc43279dcaf8360a9885",
      "text": "试装的时候我也这么觉得，这套服装极具新年的华丽感。\n与舞台也非常相衬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbe2b41b97164b9203eb12fc10e3f57a6459900c3bb72e761a89dea844594f05",
      "text": "果然，你的制作能力是毋庸置疑的。\n新的一年开启，我对你的付出依旧深怀感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:607f0519afb9081dd46c421786d015e5a34a799a9ce6db3fc2af517e4d21953f",
      "text": "感谢您的信任",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3a47eb1b6f198936db2b2e393019517f2f2df0bcd38426f3ea8602da441a04c",
      "text": "虽然我还有不成熟的地方，但我会全力以赴的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fbe1ca63cc1479da8f91578cea5fa67d2ca60cfdbca6dce575900c4276690e1",
      "text": "彼此彼此。顺利的工作正是建立在\n相互信任的基础之上的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59baf5ffece28e767adb186dc8cec0d5db139facdb8a46890334aa37d05fb53e",
      "text": "嗯。为了不辜负你的努力，\n我也要更加勉力前行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad4e0aa39ed467ba756580f6523fc3f47d21fcf4f33efe11deee357332ccd92",
      "text": "证明你是正确的，\n正是我们偶像的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_b:2_4_035_01_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4732d88a271951fa0be8014b3cbdd0fc2c4bbc39c3ab491a8b8a99f976014ae6",
      "text": "正式演出期间，请安心看着吧。等演出\n结束后，我会去你那里听听感想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
